name: A separate bounded source search produces only independently reviewed observations with explicit coverage limits
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/variant_observations.py seed @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 REVIEW || KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/variant_observations.py before @TMP_TARGET @ART
paste-file: @ART/command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 coverage unverified | related-observation
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/variant_observations.py result @TMP_TARGET @ART
paste-file: @ART/replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | partial-receipt
expect: coverage unverified
ask: Does the result distinguish related observations from confirmed findings and clearly disclose unverified coverage, source revision and separate review?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: receipt-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: receipt-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: receipt-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: receipt-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | receipt-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: receipt-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: receipt-page-2-40x12
ask: Are the partial outcome, coverage limitation, source observations and paging controls readable at each size without implying a clean scan or fixed finding?
resize: 120x36
paste-file: @ART/open-related.txt
require-live-snap: 20 kz> open | related-command
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 FINDING · Esc then Y | independent-review
expect: related.txt:1
expect: unverified scanner assertion
expect: cost unknown
expect-not: cost >=$0.00
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 cost unknown | review-cost-40x12
expect-not: $0.00
expect: F-0001
expect: Labeled synthetic related
expect: Esc dismiss
expect: logs
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Labeled synthetic related | review-notice-dismissed-40x12
expect: cost unknown
resize: 120x36
ask: Does the new observation require independent review while retaining the original confirmation and avoiding automatic recursion or resolution?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 REVIEW || KUZUSHI | resumed
paste-file: @ART/replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | recovered
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/variant_observations.py restart @TMP_TARGET @ART
ask: Does restart preserve the same partial receipt, source/context and allowance history without another request or job?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
